  message: "Cross-ref backfill (2026-05-30, linked-pile investigation): this item is a concrete language-axis instance of INV-kurup's \"identifier-bearing fields emit non-canonical formats\" META — the language field receives the raw Solidity require() error-message string instead of a known-language catalog value, contaminating four downstream surfaces from one ingestion at solidity.py:355-369. Candidate for re-parenting under INV-kurup as a member, alongside the existing INV-hunup / INV-bazij / INV-zudob / INV-lidul cluster. Sub-pile A peer (mechanism: wrong-value emission, not field unpopulated): differs from INV-golap and INV-loguk which are unpopulated-field cases."  # c6d1
